Package: Golem_App_Project
Title: Market Dynamics Explorer
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nursultan", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "nursulta@ualberta.ca")
Description: Golem Shiny application for exploring market dynamics across
    commodity futures markets and US Constant Maturity Treasury yield curves.
    Covers forward curve structure, volatility, cross-market co-dynamics,
    seasonality, and hedge ratio analysis.
